<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">

<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Dunia Landak - Lagu</title>

<style>

:root {
  --background:url("images.jfif") center/cover fixed;
  --overlay:rgba(20,19,17,.88);
  --paper:#efe9dc;
  --panel:rgba(38,36,31,.88);
  --line:#454137;
  --gold:#c8992f;
  --muted:#9a9482;
}

* {
  box-sizing:border-box;
}

body {
  margin:0;
  min-height:100vh;

  background:
    linear-gradient(var(--overlay),var(--overlay)),
    var(--background);

  background-color:#1c1b19;
  background-attachment:fixed;

  color:var(--paper);
  font-family:monospace;
}

header,main,footer {
  max-width:1000px;
  margin:auto;
}

header {
  padding:60px 24px 35px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}

header a {
  color:var(--gold);
  text-decoration:none;
}

h1 {
  font-family:Georgia,serif;
  font-size:3rem;
  margin:15px 0 5px;
}

header p {
  color:var(--muted);
}

main {
  padding:40px 24px 80px;
}

.card {
  background:var(--panel);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:20px;
  margin-bottom:5px;
}

footer {
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:25px 24px;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.7rem;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<a href="index.html">← Kembali ke Dunia Landak</a>

<h1>Lagu</h1>

<p>Kumpulan lagu dan audio.</p>

</header>

<main>

<div class="card">
  Belum ada lagu.
</div>

</main>

<footer>
Dunia Landak · Lagu
</footer>

</body>
</html>
